From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] add custom search engine feature

Allow users to manually add custom search engines instead of
waiting for Chrome to auto-detect them via OpenSearch. Users
can specify:
- Name: Display name for the search engine
- Keyword: Shortcut to use in address bar  
- Search URL: URL with %s placeholder for query

This provides a much better UX than the default Chrome behavior
which requires visiting a site multiple times before the search
engine becomes available.
---

